				PRINTFORML \@TARGET != ARG?%PARSE("peek")%#peek\@ into the pitfall where %CALLNAME:ARG% had fallen into.
				PRINTFORML %CALLNAME:ARG% can be seen %TEXTR(@"slumped on %HIS_HER(ARG)% butt/upside down with %HIS_HER(ARG)% \@ EQUIP:下半身下着２ ? panties # naked crotch\@ exposed/passed out")% at the bottom of the pit.
